  "name": "HOL4",
  "description": "HOL4 is an interactive theorem prover for higher-order logic based on the LCF approach, ensuring logical consistency through a small trusted kernel of primitive inference rules. It provides a robust environment for formal verification and mathematical formalization, featuring an extensible tactic system, a powerful simplifier, and seamless integration with external SAT/SMT solvers. The system is primarily implemented in Standard ML and supports complex proof engineering for hardware, software, and pure mathematics.",
